  "description": "<p data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"585\">Beleef de Olympische Spelen op een vrolijke en competitieve manier met <strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"398\">Mario & Sonic op de Olympische Spelen</strong>! Kies uit iconische personages uit beide werelden en neem deel aan diverse sporten, minigames en uitdagende evenementen. Perfect voor families, feestjes en sportieve multiplayer-sessies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"709\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"628\">In Nette Staat</strong>, volledig getest en 100% functioneel.<br data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"669\">Wordt <strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"708\">standaard met doosje geleverd</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"728\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<li data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"771\">🏅 Speel tientallen Olympische sporten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"836\">🌈 Iconische personages zoals Mario, Luigi, Sonic & Knuckles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"869\">👥 Meerdere multiplayer-modi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"906\">🎮 Geschikt voor alle leeftijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"959\">🔄 Afwisseling tussen moderne en retro 2D-events</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"988\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<li data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1041\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1001\">Titel:</strong> Mario & Sonic op de Olympische Spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1075\"><strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1057\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1105\"><strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1088\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1134\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1134\"><strong data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1118\">Genre:</strong> Sport / Party</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1183\"><strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1149\">Spelers:</strong> 1–4 lokaal • Online multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1199\">Geleverd:</strong> Met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1252\"><strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1242\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
